{"text":"kuruntokai","n":208,"lines":["ஒன்றே னல்லேன் ஒன்றுவென் குன்றத்துப்","பொருகளிறு மிதித்த நெரிதாள் வேங்கை","குறவர் மகளிர் கூந்தற் பெய்ம்மார்","நின்றுகொய மலரும் நாடனொ","டொன்றேன் றோழி ஒன்றினானே"],"tr":["oṉṟē ṉallēṉ oṉṟuveṉ kuṉṟattup","porukaḷiṟu mititta neritāḷ vēṅkai","kuṟavar makaḷir kūntaṟ peymmār","niṉṟukoya malarum nāṭaṉo","ṭoṉṟēṉ ṟōḻi oṉṟiṉāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 2×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 4"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 5, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஒன்றே","tr":"oṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒன்","tr":"oṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"னல்லேன்","tr":"ṉallēṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னல்","tr":"ṉal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லேன்","tr":"lēṉ"}]},{"text":"ஒன்றுவென்","tr":"oṉṟuveṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒன்","tr":"oṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுவென்","tr":"ṟuveṉ"}]},{"text":"குன்றத்துப்","tr":"kuṉṟattup","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குன்","tr":"kuṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றத்","tr":"ṟat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"துப்","tr":"tup"}]}],[{"text":"பொருகளிறு","tr":"porukaḷiṟu","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொரு","tr":"poru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"களி","tr":"kaḷi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"மிதித்த","tr":"mititta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிதித்","tr":"mitit"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"நெரிதாள்","tr":"neritāḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெரி","tr":"neri"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தாள்","tr":"tāḷ"}]},{"text":"வேங்கை","tr":"vēṅkai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேங்","tr":"vēṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]}],[{"text":"குறவர்","tr":"kuṟavar","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குற","tr":"kuṟa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வர்","tr":"var"}]},{"text":"மகளிர்","tr":"makaḷir","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்","tr":"ḷir"}]},{"text":"கூந்தற்","tr":"kūntaṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூந்","tr":"kūn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தற்","tr":"taṟ"}]},{"text":"பெய்ம்மார்","tr":"peymmār","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பெய்ம்","tr":"peym"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மார்","tr":"mār"}]}],[{"text":"நின்றுகொய","tr":"niṉṟukoya","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நின்","tr":"niṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுகொ","tr":"ṟuko"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"மலரும்","tr":"malarum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மல","tr":"mala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரும்","tr":"rum"}]},{"text":"நாடனொ","tr":"nāṭaṉo","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனொ","tr":"ṭaṉo"}]}],[{"text":"டொன்றேன்","tr":"ṭoṉṟēṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"டொன்","tr":"ṭoṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றேன்","tr":"ṟēṉ"}]},{"text":"றோழி","tr":"ṟōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோ","tr":"ṟō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"ஒன்றினானே","tr":"oṉṟiṉāṉē","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒன்","tr":"oṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றினா","tr":"ṟiṉā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஒன்றேன்","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்றேன்","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"I will not agree"}],"gloss":"I will not agree"},{"surface":"அல்லேன்","parts":[{"text":"அல்லேன்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"I am not"}],"gloss":"I am not"},{"surface":"ஒன்றுவென்","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்றுவென்","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"I will agree"}],"gloss":"I will agree"},{"surface":"குன்றத்து","parts":[{"text":"குன்றத்து","lemma":"குன்று","gloss":"of the hill"}],"gloss":"of the hill"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொருகளிறு","parts":[{"text":"பொருகளிறு","lemma":"பொருகளிறு","gloss":"fighting male elephant"}],"gloss":"fighting male elephant"},{"surface":"மிதித்த","parts":[{"text":"மிதித்த","lemma":"மிதி","gloss":"stepped on"}],"gloss":"stepped on"},{"surface":"நெரிதாள்","parts":[{"text":"நெரிதாள்","lemma":"நெரிதாள்","gloss":"broken branch"}],"gloss":"broken branch"},{"surface":"வேங்கை","parts":[{"text":"வேங்கை","lemma":"வேங்கை","gloss":"Kino tree"}],"gloss":"Kino tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குறவர்","parts":[{"text":"குறவர்","lemma":"குறவர்","gloss":"hill-tribe men"}],"gloss":"hill-tribe men"},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"மகளிர்","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"},{"surface":"கூந்தல்","parts":[{"text":"கூந்தல்","lemma":"கூந்தல்","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"hair"},{"surface":"பெய்ம்மார்","parts":[{"text":"பெய்ம்மார்","lemma":"பெய்ம்மார்","gloss":"in order to wear"}],"gloss":"in order to wear"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நின்று","parts":[{"text":"நின்று","lemma":"நின்று","gloss":"having stood"}],"gloss":"having stood"},{"surface":"கொய","parts":[{"text":"கொய","lemma":"கொய்","gloss":"to pluck"}],"gloss":"to pluck"},{"surface":"மலரும்","parts":[{"text":"மலரும்","lemma":"மலர்","gloss":"blooming"}],"gloss":"blooming"},{"surface":"நாடனொ","parts":[{"text":"நாடன்","lemma":"நாடன்","gloss":"man of the land"},{"text":"ஒ","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with (part 1)"}],"gloss":"with the man of the land (part 1)"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"டொன்றேன்","parts":[{"text":"டொன்றேன்","lemma":"டொன்றேன்","gloss":"with (part 2) + I will not agree"}],"gloss":"with (part 2) + I will not agree","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"ஒன்றினானே","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்றினானே","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"he has united indeed"}],"gloss":"he has united indeed"}]}],"literal":"I will not agree, I am not; I will agree, of the hill / fighting male elephant stepped on, broken-branched Vengai tree / hill-tribe women, in their hair to wear, / standing to pluck, blooms, with the man of the land / I will not agree, O friend, but he has united indeed.","translation":"I am not one to say 'I will not unite'; I will indeed unite. But how can I say I will not unite with the lord of the land, O friend, where the Vengai tree, its branches crushed by a fighting bull elephant, blooms with flowers that the daughters of the hill-folk can stand and pluck to adorn their hair? He has already united with me.","modern":"தோழி! நான் அவனுடன் சேரமாட்டேன் என்று சொல்லவில்லை; சேரவே செய்வேன். சண்டையிடும் ஆண் யானை மிதித்ததால் கிளைகள் உடைந்த வேங்கை மரத்தின் மலர்களை, குறவர் வீட்டுப் பெண்கள் தங்கள் கூந்தலில் சூடுவதற்காக நின்று கொண்டே பறிக்கும்படியாக மலரும் மலைநாட்டை உடைய தலைவனுடன் நான் சேரமாட்டேன் என்று எப்படிச் சொல்வேன்? அவன் ஏற்கனவே என்னோடு மனதால் ஒன்றிவிட்டானே!","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend who is concerned about her secret love affair. She reassures her friend that she is completely committed to the hero and has no intention of refusing him. The imagery of the Vengai tree, whose branch was crushed by a fighting elephant but now bends low enough for the hill-tribe girls to easily pluck its flowers, serves as an uḷḷurai (implied metaphor). It suggests that although the hero is powerful and formidable like the elephant, he has humbled himself to make his love accessible to the heroine. The key words are 'ஒன்றேன்' (I will not unite), 'ஒன்றுவென்' (I will unite), and 'ஒன்றினானே' (he has united indeed), which emphasize the theme of spiritual and physical union.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.33],[0.56,1.0],[1.07,1.3],[1.3,1.8],[1.83,2.8],[2.8,3.0],[3.0,3.0],[3.0,3.9],[3.9,4.8],[4.8,5.2],[5.2,5.3],[5.3,5.7],[5.7,6.69],[6.8,7.3],[7.3,7.53],[7.64,7.7],[7.91,8.12],[8.12,9.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.46],[0.57,1.3],[1.3,1.8],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,3.4],[3.4,3.9],[3.9,4.5],[4.5,4.7],[4.7,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,6.3],[6.3,6.8],[6.8,7.6],[7.9,8.4],[8.4,8.69],[9.2,9.65],[9.65,9.8],[9.8,10.9]]},"sync":[[["ஒன்றேன்","I will not agree"]],[["ஒன்றேன்","I will not agree"],["அல்லேன்","I am not"]],[["ஒன்றுவென்","I will agree"]],[["குன்றத்து","of the hill"]],[["பொருகளிறு","fighting male elephant"]],[["மிதித்த","stepped on"]],[["நெரிதாள்","broken branch"]],[["வேங்கை","Kino tree"]],[["குறவர்","hill-tribe men"]],[["மகளிர்","women"]],[["கூந்தல்","hair"]],[["பெய்ம்மார்","in order to wear"]],[["நின்று","having stood"],["கொய","to pluck"]],[["மலரும்","blooming"]],[["நாடனொ","with the man of the land (part 1)"]],[["டொன்றேன்","with (part 2) + I will not agree"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["ஒன்றினானே","he has united indeed"]]]}